WEBVTT

00:02:59.175 --> 00:03:01.135
Well, it’s what I call “FOMA”.

00:03:01.135 --> 00:03:02.345
Not FOMO,

00:03:02.345 --> 00:03:05.348
the fear of missing out
on a great party or either opportunity,

00:03:05.389 --> 00:03:08.768
but FOMA, the fear of missing out
on competitive advantage.

00:03:08.809 --> 00:03:10.853
Data is a source of competitive advantage.

00:03:10.853 --> 00:03:12.939
So why would companies want to give it up?

00:03:13.606 --> 00:03:15.691
In our research, over the last two years,

00:03:15.733 --> 00:03:19.111
we've been looking
at many different solutions

00:03:19.153 --> 00:03:21.447
that would improve the citizen experience

00:03:21.489 --> 00:03:24.700
and as well sustainability
solutions for cities.

00:03:24.742 --> 00:03:27.954
And what we found is that 85 percent
of those solutions

00:03:27.954 --> 00:03:29.956
require much more data sharing

00:03:29.997 --> 00:03:32.875
across companies, individuals and cities.